# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# The site is a set of real .html files, so there is no SPA catch-all here
# — a catch-all would turn every typo into the home page and hide broken
# links from anyone testing, including me.

# Extensionless URLs, because /items reads better than /items.html and is
# what people will type.
/champions      /champions.html   200
/items          /items.html       200
/runes          /runes.html       200
/spells         /spells.html      200
/guides         /index.html#guides 302
/write          /create.html      200

# The masteries page was folded into the creator.
/masteries      /create.html      301
/masteries.html /create.html      301
